  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Simple Hats 是一款可透過 JSON 設定的裝飾性帽子模組，允許使用者自訂各種帽子，並提供多種附加選項，如變體、染色功能、粒子效果和季節性設定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組預設包含近 300 款自訂帽子，使用者可隨意新增/移除/修改。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/468/649/hats.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"1752\" height=\"945\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>其他功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 帽子可透過擊敗敵對生物掉落的驚喜袋（右鍵開啟）獲得，或於各種戰利品箱中找到。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 多餘或不想要的帽子可回收，用於製作新的或升級的袋子，以獲得新或更稀有的帽子。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 帽子可放置於可製作的帽子架上展示。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子具有可透過合成格切換的變體模型/材質。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子可像普通皮革一樣染色，並可於鍋中清洗褪色。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子具有不同的粒子效果，可在第三人稱視角或他人身上看到。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 此外，設有季節系統，在特定時間內，普通袋子會掉落特殊驚喜袋。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>0.3.0 更新：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; 新增由 ArtsyDy 創作的 60 多款新帽子。注意：若從舊版本更新，需刪除並重新生成 simplehats.json 以獲取新帽子。</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/668/hatsnew2.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"1565\" height=\"618\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>0.2.0 更新：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; 新增由 StarArtsy 創作的 30 多款新帽子，包含為 TwilightStar 的 Trinkets and Baubles 製作的泰迪熊帽。</span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/961/hatsnew.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"772\" height=\"523\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>特殊合成配方：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">根據稀有度回收不需要的帽子：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/494/scrapcommon.PNG\" alt=\"帽子回收（基於稀有度）\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">升級碎片稀有度或根據稀有度用碎片製作袋子：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/493/scrapcrafting.PNG\" alt=\"碎片升級與袋子製作（基於稀有度）\" width=\"300\" height=\"322\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">為運氣不佳者（或特別的人 :) ）預設的可合成帽子：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/492/simplehat.PNG\" alt=\"預設可合成帽子（為運氣不佳者 :) ）\" width=\"300\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">切換帽子變體：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/491/variant.PNG\" alt=\"切換變體帽子\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">染色帽子：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/490/dye.PNG\" alt=\"帽子染色\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>依賴項（Fabric/NeoForge 1.21.1 及以上）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必需： </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Accessories：帽子透過 Accessories 裝備</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; owo-lib：處理 SimpleHats 設定檔</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>依賴項（Forge 1.20.4 及以下）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必需： </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Curios：帽子裝備於裝飾性 Curio 欄位</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>可選： </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; JEI：Simple Hats 支援新增自訂配方至 JEI</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Optifine：若安裝 Optifine，許多帽子將自動啟用發光材質（推薦）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>依賴項（Fabric 1.20.4 及以下）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必需：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Trinkets：帽子裝備於 Trinket 的「帽子」欄位</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cloth Config：用於非 JSON 設定選項</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>可選：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Continuity 或 Optifine+Optifabric：若安裝任一，許多帽子將自動啟用發光材質（推薦）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mod Menu：Simple Hats 支援 Mod Menu，可在遊戲內存取設定</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>請記得將任何問題回報至頁面頂部連結的 GitHub 問題追蹤器！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>需要聯繫 Fonny？<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">（問題/錯誤）</span> 點擊下方徽章（Fonny / Coding Discord）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZPdwrtvBKm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1202561752294760478?labelColor=violet&amp;color=purple\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"39\"></strong></span></a></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kfVjTWVz7N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>為感謝捐贈，您可獲得獨特福利，包括專屬裝飾性帽子！</strong></span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kfVjTWVz7N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fstarartsy\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/starartsy</a></strong></span></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fBSJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/546e6fab-b6da-4f3f-b9ea-eaa0cdaffafe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></span></p>",
